repository-code: "https://github.com/carstenartur/Regelsuche"
url: "https://github.com/carstenartur/Regelsuche"
abstract: >-
  Regelsuche is an experimental mathematics and symbolic discovery platform for
  rewrite search, equality saturation, hypothesis mining, counterexample search,
  proof workflows, and reproducible mathematical exploration. It treats
  mathematical expressions as positions in a rule-based transformation game and
  records search paths as replayable discovery evidence.
license: MIT
version: "0.2.0-SNAPSHOT"
keywords:
